 Plan: Separate sample.c into scene_render, ui_panels, and shared header

 Context

 sample.c is 6615 lines containing the entire OpenGL REPL: types, globals, REPL core logic, 3D scene rendering, UI panels (code editor, help overlay, var sliders, config menu), input handlers, and main().
 The goal is to extract the 3D scene rendering and UI panel rendering into their own files to improve maintainability.

